---
title: sd MF-01b: Internal HR Reviews Job & Client Uploads Signed Service Agreement
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor HR as Internal HR
  actor CL as Client Company User
  participant API as Job / ServiceAgreement Endpoints
  participant H as Agreement & Job Handlers
  participant R2 as Cloudflare R2 Storage
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  HR->>API: POST /api/v1/internal/jobs/{id}/approve
  API->>H: Send(ApproveJobCommand)
  H->>DB: Set Job -> PENDING_AGREEMENT (Headhunt / Sourcing)
  API-->>HR: 200 OK (Awaiting Service Agreement)
  HR->>API: POST /api/v1/internal/jobs/{id}/service-agreements
  API->>H: Send(CreateServiceAgreementProposalCommand)
  H->>R2: Render & upload draft Agreement PDF (SHA-256 hash)
  H->>DB: Insert ServiceAgreement (SENT_TO_CLIENT) & notify Client
  API-->>HR: 201 Created (ServiceAgreementDto)
  CL->>API: POST /api/v1/client/jobs/{id}/service-agreements/{aid}/response
  API->>H: Send(RespondToServiceAgreementCommand)
  alt Action == REQUEST_CHANGES
    H->>DB: Update Agreement -> CHANGE_REQUESTED & notify Internal HR
    API-->>CL: 200 OK (Change Request Recorded)
  else Action == ACCEPT & Upload Signed Agreement Copy
    H->>DB: Update Agreement -> ACCEPTED
    CL->>API: POST /api/v1/client/jobs/{id}/service-agreements/{aid}/upload-signed
    API->>H: Send(UploadSignedServiceAgreementCommand)
    H->>R2: Upload signed PDF/Docx copy (max 25MB)
    H->>DB: Save SignedDocumentStorageKey, SignedAt & notify Internal HR
    API-->>CL: 200 OK (Signed Copy Uploaded)
    HR->>API: POST /api/v1/internal/jobs/{id}/approve (Verify signed copy)
    API->>H: Send(ApproveJobCommand)
    H->>DB: Agreement -> SIGNED; Job -> ACTIVE (Headhunt) or PENDING_PAYMENT (Sourcing)
    API-->>HR: 200 OK (Job Activated / Deposit Invoice Created)
  end
